sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI middleware
    participant H as RecommendationHandlers
    participant P as ProfileLookupService
    participant EML as ExperienceMemoryLayer
    participant GS as GraphStore
    participant R as RecommendationEngine
    participant O as HAOE
    participant SC as Scoring EDS TAPL OSE Ranker
    participant EB as EventBus

    C->>API: POST /v1/recommend plus X-API-Key
    API->>API: auth rate limit request_id
    API->>H: recommend request

    H->>P: enrich_context customer_id
    P-->>H: enriched CustomerContext

    H->>EML: enrich_context get_calibration
    EML-->>H: memory_before snapshot

    H->>GS: load prior TKGE snapshot
    H->>R: recommend context candidates limit

    R->>O: choose_route inference_mode confidence
    O-->>R: tier rules slm ml llm

    alt Rules tier
        R->>R: RulesEngine.infer_from_context
    else SLM tier
        R->>R: DistilledSLM SLMClient
    else ML tier
        R->>R: MLInferenceService sklearn
    else LLM tier
        R->>R: LLMClient enrich optional
    end

    loop Each candidate
        R->>SC: EDS TAPL OSE final_hybrid_score
    end

    R-->>H: ranked recommendations
    H->>EML: record_recommendations
    H->>GS: save TKGE snapshot
    H->>EB: publish recommendation.created
    H-->>C: RecommendationResponseV1
